# kbflash patterns: name = steps. Edit freely; these override the built-ins.
# Try one with:  kbflash NAME      List them with:  kbflash --list
#
# A step is LEVEL/MS:
#   on   your level if the keyboard is lit, 100% if it's dark (so it always shows)
#   off  0%
#   me   your level
#   0-100  an exact percent
# Put ~ in front to fade into a step over its MS instead of switching instantly.
# xN repeats the steps since the last xN. Every pattern ends back on your level.

done    = off/120 on/120 x3
ask     = off/150 on/250 x2
error   = off/120 on/600 off/120 on/150 off/120 on/600
breathe = ~off/700 ~on/700 x2

